  "description": {
    "text": "Four tins decorated with artwork from Japanese booster packs, each with a holofoil reprint of one of the four promos Target gave away at its food courts from February 2004, Treecko, Torchic, Mudkip or Whismur, two booster packs (EX FireRed & LeafGreen and EX Hidden Legends) and a sticker sheet. The Target copies are non-holo, dated 2003, with the e-Reader strip; the tin reprints are dated 2004 and have no strip. Kagemaru Himeno drew all four.",
